━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ Packet is Tuple

+ value U64

────────────────────
+ This ~ Byte

~ ignored U8 len \length
    This(len)

    .. length ~
        ~ b2 U8 value \inner
            value

            .. inner ~
                ~ U8{0}
                    b2 as U64

